<title>USA: Novitron sets reverse stock split.</title>
<headline>Novitron sets reverse stock split.</headline>
<dateline>NEWTON, Mass. 1996-11-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Novitron International Inc said Wednesday its board approved a one-for-three reverse stock split.</p>
<p>Novitron, which provides medical products and services, had an average of 3.9 million shares outstanding for the quarter ended September 30.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610</p>
</text>
